Z||000005||Eric_PA||02-19-2001||09:49 AM||||Thanks Jon,<BR>     I was debating if I should just stop by at his place or not, but having the number will be much better. You guessed it, I droped the QUAD 4 project. I also picked up a Getrag 5 speed trans and was considering a V8, but now looks like a performance V6 rebuild with a possible turbo down the road. The problem with these cars is that there is so much you can do with them that I can't make my mind up  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <BR>Thanks again for all of your help<BR>Eric||||reg||1
